{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is a demo of Zugaran. Zugaran</i> is a casual and simple psychological horror where you repeat the same nightly ritual, but each time, new horrors unfold. Uncover fragments of your past, dodge lurking monsters, and slowly piece together the truth behind. In the <i>demo</i> you will uncover first 5 short episodes of the main game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016140/extras/913173c6c6a7f0d8abc09fdaf69a4ab6.poster.avif?t=1758039383\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016140/extras/913173c6c6a7f0d8abc09fdaf69a4ab6.webm?t=1758039383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016140/extras/913173c6c6a7f0d8abc09fdaf69a4ab6.mp4?t=1758039383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You rented an apartment in Dreamtown for a short business trip. But each night, you wake up to use the toilet... and reality cracks a little more. Something is wrong. The apartment isn\u2019t quite what it seems. The routine feels too familiar. The walls shift. The phone rings. And every night, the terror gets closer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Is this your home, or your mind trying to escape?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016140/extras/527040963cb4af0e34f441a7aac5dfee.poster.avif?t=1758039383\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016140/extras/527040963cb4af0e34f441a7aac5dfee.webm?t=1758039383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016140/extras/527040963cb4af0e34f441a7aac5dfee.mp4?t=1758039383\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016140?t=1758039383","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016140?t=1758039383","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016140/da658bfecbe2cc1224250e9c9aa8079acf22b63d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758039383","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016140/da658bfecbe2cc1224250e9c9aa8079acf22b63d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758039383","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Includes depictions of urination."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This is a demo of Zugaran. Zugaran</i> is a casual and simple psychological horror where you repeat the same nightly ritual, but each time, new horrors unfold. Uncover fragments of your past, dodge lurking monsters, and slowly piece together the truth behind. In the <i>demo</i> you will uncover first 5 short episodes of the main game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016140/extras/913173c6c6a7f0d8abc09fdaf69a4ab6.poster.avif?t=1758039383\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016140/extras/913173c6c6a7f0d8abc09fdaf69a4ab6.webm?t=1758039383\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016140/extras/913173c6c6a7f0d8abc09fda